File name: LCSSLOOP.MP
Path description: Earthen Catacombs Full Loop 
Path starts: Lost City Spiral Staircase
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 7
Level recommendation: 40+
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: flesh ripper, ancestrial guardian, bone warrior,
                      crane spirit, monkey spirit, gorilla spirit
Additional information:

Included in the zip are KUELLCSS.MP and LCSSKUEL.MP which are paths
to and from the start of this loop.

This loop enters every room in the earthen catacombs at least once.
It uses the teleport rooms to do this so you MUST have a Golden Idol
or else it will fail.  The only room it doesn't enter is Kuel's room
so you can loop this partied up.   Kuel's room is West after step
number 219 should you wish to insert the step to auto give them to Kuel.
